comments =  Processed with adaptive RFI removal applied to all 4 channels, 2 subbands.  Heavy RFI remains in all 4 channels at upper and lower edges of frequency band.  Manually advanced start of processing by 3000 m so that final product covers in-situ site at Bridgeville, CA. 
